    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.trailspace\n\n### Description\n\nIf you enable mini.trailspace and snacks.nvim dashboard, you will see trailspace highlighting until an highlight update happens.\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Install snacks.nvim (with dashboard) and mini.trailspace.\r\n2. Open neovim.\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nWhen Noevim is opened without an input file, I see this result:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1153\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-12 at 11 55 31\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89c4c1d3-f92d-4d94-ae11-c63b702e2c04\" />\r\n\r\nIf I open a new buffer, like lazy configuration window, the highlight gets updated and everything is correct:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1153\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-12 at 11 56 02\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9ec54a9-6c85-48f0-8b23-221354d7ebdb\" />\r\n\r\nThe problem does not happen if mini.trailspace is disabled.\r\n",
