        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I'd suggest disabling locally to dashboard's buffer with `vim.b.minitrailspace_disable = true` set only in necessary buffer(s). Here is [a recipe for common case of disabling based on filetype](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e78a98ac2f984fb30e31c016f97d57e2d60a3ee7/doc/mini.txt#L339-L341). The filetype [seems to be `snacks_dashboad`](https://github.com/folke/snacks.nvim/blob/52086010d3f72949a30c45c2cc4faa0b0286d097/lua/snacks/dashboard.lua#L156).",
