        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> It works but it still flashes red on start. Would be nice to have a `disabledFileTypes` setting or similar to avoid these race conditions.\n\nThe potential `disabledFileTypes` is essentially the same as [suggested recipe for disabling per filetype](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e78a98ac2f984fb30e31c016f97d57e2d60a3ee7/doc/mini.txt#L339-L341). There should be no flashing if buffer-local variable is set during startup (i.e. not lazy loaded).",
