        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I have both mini and snacks set to `lazy=false`. mini has priority `9999` and snacks has priority `999`.  I have the following snippet in mini's `config` function:\n\n```lua\n\t\tlocal disabled_line_decoration = {\n\t\t\t\"snacks_dashboard\",\n\t\t\t\"oil\",\n\t\t\t\"notify\",\n\t\t\t\"snacks_notif\",\n\t\t\t\"lazy\",\n\t\t\t\"mason\",\n\t\t\t\"noice\",\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tlocal disabled_animation = {\n\t\t\t\"snacks_dashboard\",\n\t\t\t\"notify\",\n\t\t\t\"noice\",\n\t\t\t\"snacks_notif\",\n\t\t\t\"oil\",\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"Filetype\", {\n\t\t\tcallback = function(args)\n\t\t\t\tlocal ft = vim.bo[args.buf].filetype\n\t\t\t\tif vim.tbl_contains(disabled_line_decoration, ft) then\n\t\t\t\t\tvim.b[args.buf].minitrailspace_disable = true\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tif vim.tbl_contains(disabled_animation, ft) then\n\t\t\t\t\tvim.b[args.buf].minianimate_disable = true\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend,\n\t\t})\n\n\t\tvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\n\t\t\tpattern = \"SnacksDashboardOpened\",\n\t\t\tcallback = function(args)\n\t\t\t\tvim.b[args.buf].minitrailspace_disable = true\n\t\t\tend,\n\t\t})\n```\n\nAm I missing something? I still see trailspace flashing before its disabled.",
